WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.110
- Wait Sofia, so is it true your husband,

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:03.390
this is like, one of my favorite things,

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:06.670
your husband Joe holds a
Dungeons and Dragons club

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:07.503
in your house?

00:00:07.503 --> 00:00:09.282
I mean, these photos, and I actually,

00:00:09.282 --> 00:00:10.993
once I heard about this, I actually--

00:00:10.993 --> 00:00:12.250
- Do you play?

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:13.230
Do you play this?

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.387
- I want to!

00:00:14.387 --> 00:00:16.943
I'm such a nerd alert, I literally went

00:00:16.943 --> 00:00:19.870
down a little rabbit hole
of watching it on YouTube

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:22.430
of like, him talking about who's
come in and out of the game

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:25.280
and it's the most random group of people.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.113
So this is all true?

00:00:26.113 --> 00:00:28.549
- It's super weird, they're really weird.

00:00:28.549 --> 00:00:29.471
(laughing)

00:00:29.471 --> 00:00:30.860
But it's great, I love it

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:34.530
that he comes and do it here in the house

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:37.053
but now that they are in quarantine,

00:00:37.053 --> 00:00:39.364
they're doing it on Zoom,

00:00:39.364 --> 00:00:41.840
so they have still been playing.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.930
It's crazy 'cause they can
do something, this game

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:47.940
for like, six, seven hours
and they sing, they clap,

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.840
they, I don't know what
they're doing down there.

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:53.080
It's like something really
weird that I can't understand

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:54.537
but it sounds fun.

00:00:54.537 --> 00:00:56.955
- You know most people who
play Dungeons and Dragons

00:00:56.955 --> 00:00:58.860
don't even meet pretty girls.

00:00:58.860 --> 00:00:59.870
To marry one...

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:02.320
(laughing)

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:04.860
- I was like, I love that
you ended up with the guy

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:06.473
that plays Dungeons and Dragons.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:10.060
- Joe is a complete nerd.

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:13.360
I always tell him that he's
trapped in the wrong body.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.980
It's like they put a nerd in this body

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:18.860
and it doesn't make any sense to me but...

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:20.480
- My man, he's like me.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:21.514
He's right there with me.

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:23.310
(laughing)

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:25.160
I'm gonna play with him, I'm telling you.

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:27.100
We're gonna do a Dungeons
and Dragons together,

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:27.933
I love it!

00:01:27.933 --> 00:01:30.990
- Well you have to, Kelly
and you can come too.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.215
- It looks like a man's club,
it looks like Little Rascals,

00:01:33.215 --> 00:01:34.949
like women aren't invited but...

00:01:34.949 --> 00:01:36.152
(laughing)

00:01:36.152 --> 00:01:38.360
- No, no, sometimes there's been,

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:41.720
no there's been girls
playing here many times.

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:44.215
I mean, it's a small percentage but yes,

00:01:44.215 --> 00:01:46.620
they do come and play here.

